  "content": "\n\n<h2># 永久抗重力附加模組</h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">提供額外功能。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2># 需安裝 Mekanism</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2># 功能特色</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/490/838/config.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"496\" height=\"372\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1289/532/config-2.png\" width=\"496\" height=\"372\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1. 永久抗重力<br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 即使落地後仍可繼續飛行。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 除非在地面時按下潛行鍵。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 為何每次飛行都要雙擊空白鍵？<br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">2. 立即停止<br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 正如其名，釋放移動鍵（WASD）時會立即停止。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 能精確抵達指定位置。<br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">3. 鎖定視野 (FOV)<br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 玩家進行動作時不會改變視野角度。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; 例如拉弓或衝刺時。<br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">4. 垂直速度調節<br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 飛行時可調整上升與下降速度。<br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; 可透過按鍵切換（預設未綁定）</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">5. 靜音調節音效<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; 自 1.19.2 起可用。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 靜音飛行音效。<br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 搭配「永久抗重力」使用效果更佳。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h2># 授權條款</h2>\n<p>採用 MIT 授權，並須遵守「Mekanism」的授權規定。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2># Mod 整合包</h2>\n<p>在符合授權條款的前提下，允許用於 Mod 整合包中。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2># 問題或建議？</h2>\n<p>請由此處提交「New Issue」（新問題）。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/gisellevonbingen/Minecraft-GravitationalModulatingAdditionalUnit/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/gisellevonbingen/Minecraft-GravitationalModulatingAdditionalUnit/issues</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
